OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,6,Fmorning, just a scattering of showers.
OL,7,FCloud thickening with outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain developing in the afternoon, the
OL,9,Frain heavy in places.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with rain or showers
OL,12,Fthis evening. Drier and clearer spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping overnight, but still some
OL,14,Fshowers, these most frequent in the
OL,15,Fwest. Windy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FBright spells and showers, the
OL,18,Fshowers heavy and frequent at times.
OL,19,FFresh to strong west or southwest
OL,20,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
