OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith isolated showers on Saturday
OL,7,Fmorning, rain then spreading north.
OL,8,FWindy with heavy rain or showers on
OL,9,FSunday. Brighter with showers and
OL,10,Feasing winds on Monday.
